{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國演員李智漢在2022年10月29日發生的梨泰院嚴重踩踏事故中不幸喪生，當時年僅24歲，當時正積極參與MBC韓劇《木偶的季節》（꼭두의 계절）拍攝的他，演藝事業才剛要起步卻遭遇死劫。而10月29日為事故四周年，面對喪兒之痛的李智漢母親近況曝光，讓人鼻酸。</p><p>李智漢的母親在今年兒子8月的28歲冥誕時，公開了一篇令人柔腸寸斷的發文。她回憶，兒子生前出門前曾提起「鞋子一直掉，得去買雙鞋」，沒想到這成了最後的話語。</p><figure><img alt=\"李智漢梨泰院人踩人事件中罹難。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230327/717060682406694912082493.jpeg/Bvd18eyM_WOQN9Cd27l9bjSHq7oCU2j4MINDgjCDQ4I\"/><figcaption>李智漢梨泰院人踩人事件中罹難。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>更多李智漢的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790265253859328235798.jpeg/arQFf5ziRyCWftNiHEAY0qmNhK_4lRVPhe0mLoXtJi4\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790267405668352624017.jpeg/nNMwPT2eLq2fJdgv5fDxvKylxvdeEBoKgugcm4LoHJs\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790269783969792265813.jpeg/VkQ0TMlLquTKOmLgRnlQHfbm4gx6a0U_9newgPZ3sIA\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790271839309824872641.jpeg/XiCUKeTHyXOf5Avr9Nj2Qcg8GSdcdDUOTS_pak0v6Wo\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790274582515712827396.jpeg/4IVCvP42yyU6gY9aqMPURyY0_Xjl045fixwF9oscBfY\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790263819407360269843.jpeg/f_-R6Q8sFt04HJ_ObkUjn3pCtGMaRYyj0jJvU9Iyb1M\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790266038325248017249.jpeg/sJ2Yc_SmEiD5s193wDnsmEb2Cb0TBR11pVq9z6Vavc8\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790268425015296308624.jpeg/8bOMHBvbrN-jwxeq2pj12ULKzC80sEW2VHPiglRz4oI\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790270459383808952781.jpeg/cFOsFOAygEGH2LzkyzOgJkQFOP49Bgh9xCbrtcQm67U\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790272728633344647395.jpeg/plfozH_YC4fgWR53PFW5HfXoELm9sT57-B6M7PgejOw\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790266298241024698345.jpeg/bHWXDlN2js3-oAMGRoQ2wIg4HJ5_rfXVeTrtxnk67cY\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790268517158912028716.jpeg/98P0HEeQXZRQdqk1jvNr3Twlxjv_nqGWTY8nPE2PJzw\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790270538944512493715.jpeg/GZ9xt36zPKgCM9Vwu_XeuQlkKc6adbjSPDw1Hzw8NR8\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790272690753536691783.jpeg/eA4IghzVFkUIatQaNm_4hABlgW6sqnyQfV3WYH1d1mA\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192790275010334720593678.jpeg/k2B3aYAyxFt4geY42LPA0rOAhWnKZLL0Z-GBV2fhgVc\"/><figcaption>李智漢（Instagram@ji_han_0803）</figcaption></figure><p>為了完成一起買鞋的心願，她特地獨自外出，挑選了最防滑、絕不會脫落的鞋子當作生日禮物。然而，當店員貼心提醒「讓兒子試穿，若太小可以拿來換」，讓她心痛不已，強忍淚水結帳，隨後抱著鞋袋在店外間歇哭泣，心碎寫下「最快樂的日子變成最悲傷的日子」。</p><p>李智漢母親還將新鞋小心翼翼地擺在玄關，把鞋頭朝向屋內，期盼孩子能隨時返家試穿。為了不漏掉任何一聲問候，她甚至在玄關前鋪上被子入睡，深怕錯過與兒子相見的瞬間。她在貼文中寫下：</p><blockquote><p>生日快樂，我愛你，真的好想你。</p></blockquote><p>字裡行間流露出痛失愛子的錐心之痛。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：女星韓高恩囊腫半年暴漲至5cm　術後3天硬復工　血壓驟降交代遺言】韓高恩健康亮紅燈！親寫遺囑「財產全留給老公」。（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190329679312064512601237.jpeg/JqIotwij0hw3uLwCLHJ50QRmk22QhhbMkZ95z5Gfec8\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：女星韓高恩囊腫半年暴漲至5cm　術後3天硬復工　血壓驟降交代遺言】韓高恩健康亮紅燈！親寫遺囑「財產全留給老公」。（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩健康亮紅燈！親寫遺囑「財產全留給老公」。（YouTube@고은언니 한고은）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190332938110111744241908.png/5gNUaud3YdJ4ES81kdS8V_BxhPpHMlOITU5Hok1OR6I\"/><figcaption>韓高恩健康亮紅燈！親寫遺囑「財產全留給老公」。（YouTube@고은언니 한고은）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330498052788224639214.jpeg/ZwN_Z5KaYI_ZuOS7ODdxDnXz5CIB72nLulc_SrpXP0o\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330500338814976026194.jpeg/zo6sXPe6C5grtQ9PvqKs1LAWKO0sQF4h3_cX-N_3F_g\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330502469652480590724.jpeg/pa_l7yJi6DWMPs-BLFWSznUywA86WZ4aN3LO5zdyzuc\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330504696958976468157.jpeg/7i41CxRdZKCAl2ktLxHoLkxYnUIItylP0ntWTNJ7Vkw\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330506865545216791562.jpeg/cMkDWtPTxSFQEYwgEezD18PfsMC4bbs5B_u36Af7t-g\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330466742308864729540.jpeg/X3O5f9FaNWCOwRJKhS5Xfi7IZpw-RjgI90TE8PdExPA\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330468944449536943278.jpeg/y5B34rXxHZ_UMK51JIqyPwTkm6eerWyKJEVjGCRFYxg\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330471171756032917356.jpeg/XQxjsMWx1Cn94-sXlvncKDvXN6-jele39KT0b_Sk9G8\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330473306787840679502.jpeg/dhLdzIsMR6hahknMgpLMp8JVpHGzpNMZrst0Vq7LdFY\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330475685089280015746.jpeg/84vMLstREm3b84EDGJE4n_cAik_bC-YRTaN9302jfd8\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330465249136640730421.jpeg/ymEIH84i0qwusCN08DlkvdqR-EXOp7VcQM2w3UDNsN0\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190330467598077952612470.jpeg/i3eEi85dcXqh8U7YBGbqMMLMeV-KTW6_JpqSlyaakpc\"/><figcaption>韓高恩（Instagram@hangoeun310）</figcaption></figure><p>鄭家純才喜迎雙胞胎！見新手媽被尪一句話惹哭 喊話發「爸爸禁言手冊」</p><p>嫁富尪仍拚到胃潰瘍！米凱莉拒金援　鬆口愛子跳級自學進度</p><